            "title": "Full-Plated Ultralight Spinning Reel for Long Cast \u0026 Rock Fishing",
            "handle": "full-plated-ultralight-spinning-reel-for-long-cast-rock-fishing",
            "body_html": "\u003cp data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"669\"\u003eUpgrade your fishing game with this premium full-plated spinning reel. Designed for both fresh and saltwater, this reel features a corrosion-resistant build, high-torque drag system, and ultra-smooth retrieve. Whether you're casting long distances or targeting rock fish, its lightweight body and precision-engineered gears deliver power and control with every spin. Choose between single or double handle grips to match your fishing style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"917\"\u003e Ultralight design for fatigue-free use\u003cbr data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"714\"\u003e Anti-rust bearings for saltwater durability\u003cbr data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"762\"\u003e Smooth 5.2:1 gear ratio for efficient line retrieval\u003cbr data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"819\"\u003e Full-metal body for enhanced strength and balance\u003cbr data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"873\"\u003e Suitable for lure, drift, and rock fishing\u003c\/p\u003e",
